  boothLines:
  - Hey, jefe. ...Hey. Third time, eh? We're basically friends now. Are we friends?
  - Hot today. Is it hot? It's hot. The truck has no AC. That's why I'm sweating.
    That's the only reason.
  - Just going to work. Normal day. Normal Chuy. Normal truck. Nothing in it. I mean,
    normal stuff in it. Tools.
  - Can you go a little fast today? Not for any reason. I'm just late. Normal late.
  lineIfApproved: ...Thank you. One time. They said just one time. Then I'm out.
    ...They said one time, right?
  lineIfRejected: Back? Jefe, I can't go back with it. And I can't go back without
    it. ...Okay. I'll figure it out. I always figure it out.
  lineIfImprisoned: No, no, no, jefe, please! They know where my mom lives! They
    sent me a picture of Neto's kids outside their school. If this doesn't get there,
    they don't come for me. They go for THEM. Please!
  returnVisits: []
  bribeAmount: 200
  bribeLine: Jefe. Please. Two hundred. It's not even mine, it's theirs. They don't
    care about the money. They care that it gets there.
  newsIfApproved:
  - headline: Four Dead in Albuquerque Overdose Cluster
    body: The pills were pressed to look like ordinary painkillers. Neighbors at
      two of the homes remember a red pickup with Chihuahua plates.
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 1
  - headline: Diesel Shop Loses Its Best Mechanic
    body: '"Said he found something that paid better," the owner said. "He didn''t
      look happy about it."'
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 0
  newsIfRejected:
  - headline: "Red Pickup Found on Ju\xE1rez Overpass, Engine Running"
    body: 'The driver''s door was open. On the seat: a toolbox, a phone with 31 missed
      calls, and a photo of two children outside a school.'
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 1
  newsIfImprisoned:
  - headline: Record Drug Seizure at the Bridge
    body: Federal officials called it "a major win." The driver, 26, did not ask
      for a lawyer. He asked for a phone.
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 1
  - headline: "Ju\xE1rez Family Leaves Home Overnight"
    body: Neighbors found the door open and a pot still warm on the stove. Before
      dawn, a man was seen putting two children in a car. He did not say where they
      were going.
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 0
